Description: This package provides functions and graphical tools to perform
    power analysis and sensitivity analysis for Partial Least Squares Structural
    Equation Models (PLS-SEM). Based on the inverse square root method described
    by Kock and Hadaya (2018), it allows researchers to estimate required sample
    sizes or Minimum Detectable Effect Sizes (MDES). A Shiny App performing the same computations is available online at: https://aleansani.shinyapps.io/pls-sem-power/
